        "question": "Is it cheaper to cohabit off-campus or stay in a university hostel?",
        "answer": "Staying in a university hostel is vastly cheaper. On-campus accommodation is heavily subsidized and includes water and electricity, whereas off-campus cohabitation entails high annual rent, caretaker levies, and continuous generator fuel expenses."
